        Label:"default",
        Name:"One Small Wish",
        Texts:[{
          Text:"Hello, @initiator. I can grant one small wish to every traveler who finds me.\\n\\nIf your heart asks for company, I can call a loyal wolf companion to your side. Choose carefully; a true wish only blooms once."
